    "id": "madas/alevel-pure-i/q4",
    "question": "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-pure-i/q4-question-1.svg\" alt=\"Prove by the method of contradiction that there are no integers a and b which satisfy the following equation. 2 − = ( ) 6 a 8 b 7\" style=\"--madas-width:584.0px\"></figure>",
