      "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-pure-i/q10-solution-2.svg\" alt=\"In year two the first three weeks give 52(10) + 20, 52(10) + 2(20), 52(10) + 3(20). The new sequence starts at 540 and ends at 52(10) + 52(20) = 1560; its sum is (52/2)(540 + 1560) = 54600. Equivalently, new schemes bring 20 P52 n=1 n. [M1] [A1] The total is 27040 + 27560 = £54,600 . [M1] [A1]\" style=\"--madas-width:677.3px\"></figure>",
